    class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 sm:flex-row"
  >
    <div class="text-center leading-relaxed sm:text-left">
      <p class="font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Guildmages' Forum 魔風集會所</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs">
        本網站所提供之魔法風雲會 (Magic the Gathering) 文字和圖形資訊版權均為威世智 (Wizards of the
        Coast) 所有。
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="shrink-0">© {year} Guildmages' Forum</p>
  </div>
</footer>
